        <item>
            <title>0.15.33</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 07 Jul 2026 13:08:29 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>194</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.15.33</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>An audio-only recording no longer lights up the macOS screen-sharing indicator (the &quot;Currently Sharing / Stop Sharing&quot; control) when your output is Bluetooth. Corder was starting a screen-capture stream to feed a system-audio backup that&#x27;s been dead since 0.15.22 — so it did nothing but show a scary &quot;is recording my screen?&quot; indicator and a Stop Sharing button that killed part of the capture without stopping the recording. Screen capture now starts only when you actually record video.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
